@startuml
title Planned sequence — upload and analyze one recording
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Fraud Prevention Analyst" as Analyst
participant "React web app\n[planned]" as Web
participant "nginx\n[planned]" as Nginx
participant "FastAPI\n[skeleton implemented]" as API
participant "Upload validation\n[planned]" as Validate
participant "Analyzer seam\n[planned]" as Analyzer
database "SQLite metadata\n[planned]" as DB

Analyst -> Web: Open Analyze
Web -> Nginx: GET /api/limits
Nginx -> API: Proxy /api/limits
API --> Nginx: Limits or structured error
Nginx --> Web: Limits or structured error

alt Limits unavailable
  Web --> Analyst: Disable analysis and offer Retry
else Limits loaded
  Analyst -> Web: Select supported file and submit
  Web -> Nginx: POST /api/analyses\nmultipart file
  Nginx -> API: Enforce body limit and proxy request
  API -> API: Assign server request_id
  loop Read chunks until EOF or size cap
    API -> API: Write random temporary file
  end
  API -> Validate: Check extension, size, non-empty,\ndecode and duration

  alt Invalid or unreadable upload
    Validate --> API: Validation error
    API -> API: Delete temporary file
    API --> Nginx: 4xx structured error; no verdict; no record
    Nginx --> Web: Error with request_id
    Web --> Analyst: Accessible error and correction action
  else Valid upload
    Validate --> API: Valid temporary path
    API -> Analyzer: analyze(path) with timeout

    alt Analyzer unavailable, timeout or internal failure
      Analyzer --> API: Failure
      API -> API: Delete temporary file
      API --> Nginx: 503, 504 or 500; no verdict; no record
      Nginx --> Web: Structured error
      Web --> Analyst: Service error; no fabricated result
    else Analysis outcome returned
      Analyzer --> API: prediction, confidence, risk, versions
      API -> DB: Save metadata and processing_ms\n(no audio or original file name)
      alt Metadata write fails
        DB --> API: Failure
        API -> API: Delete temporary file
        API --> Nginx: 500 internal_error; no result shown
        Nginx --> Web: Structured error
        Web --> Analyst: Storage failure message
      else Metadata stored
        DB --> API: Stored
        API -> API: Delete temporary file
        API --> Nginx: 201 + Location + exact 8-field response
        Nginx --> Web: AnalysisResponse
        Web --> Analyst: Verdict, confidence, risk and\ndecision-support notice
      end
    end
  end
end

note over API,DB
  Planned flow from docs/api_design.md §4.3.
  Current main implements only mock GET /api/status.
end note
@enduml
